<title>UK: Clariant raises 500 mln SFR via two bonds. [CORRECTED 10:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Clariant raises 500 mln SFR via two bonds. [CORRECTED 10:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clariant AG has issued two bonds, with seven- and 10-year maturities, worth a total 500 million Swiss francs, lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston sainon Thursday.</p>
<p>The 300 million franc seven-year deal carries a 3.375 percent coupon and was priced at 101.625 (corrects from 101.58).</p>
<p>The 200 million franc 10-year deal carries a 3.75 percent coupon and was priced at 101.25.  </p>
<p>The maturity dates are on August 27 in 2004 and 2007 respectively. The payment date is August 27.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
